     "text_sample_first_streams": " |  | Public  Hearing  Notice The  Harrison  County  Commissioner\u0092s  Court  will  conduct  a  public  hearing  on  Tuesday,  February 15,  2022  at  9:00  a.m.  in  the  Commissioners\u0092  Courtroom  at  the  Harrison  County  Historic Coiuthouse,  located  at  #1  Peter  Whetstone  Square  Marshall,  Texas  75670  to  consider  comments concerning  an  order  to  participate  in  the  Texas  Enterprise  Zone  Program  and  nominate  General Cable  Industries,  Inc.,  9975  US  Highway  80  West,  Scottsville,  TX  75670,  to  the  Office  of  the Governor  as  an  Enterprise  Project.  The  hearing  will  include  discussion  of  any  tax  or  other incentives  which  might  be  available  to  the  Texas  Enterprise  Zone  Program  under  existing Harrison  County  policy.  All  interested  parties  are  encouraged  to  attend  and  present  their  views. For  additional  information,  contact  Honorable  Judge  Chad  Sims  at  903.935.8401. ^o i ^s\u00bb \u0082m m j ca CO o o CO |  | ",
     "printed_on_election_night": false,
     "saved_file": "2024_general_20241121142722_ce3dc20bec.pdf"
